          "source_line": 3402,
          "tex": "\\begin{definition}\n\\label{definition-dominant}\nLet $S$ be a scheme. A morphism $f : X \\to Y$ of algebraic spaces over $S$ is\ncalled {\\it dominant} if the image of $|f| : |X| \\to |Y|$ is dense in $|Y|$.\n\\end{definition}"
        }
